{
  "package": "Dominican Republic Combined",
  "date": "2026-07-27",
  "description": "Merged Dominican Republic television lineup using Claro TV Plan Avanzado as the immutable base and adding de-duplicated Altice Max HD video channels. Supplemental verified Dominican local/streaming stations were added for currently observed IPTV streams.",
  "source": "Conectate.com.do PDFs: Listado de Canales de Claro TV; Listado de Canales del Telecable Altice",
  "notes": "Claro is the authoritative base: every retained Claro television entry, channel number, source duplicate-number assignment, and separate SD/HD listing is preserved. Altice contributes only channel identities absent from Claro. Duplicate comparison normalizes capitalization, accents, punctuation, common provider-name variants, and SD/HD or standalone TV suffixes. When an Altice-only identity has both standard and HD listings, one version is retained and the HD representative is preferred. Added Altice channels use numbers that were unused by Claro and are placed in the closest applicable Claro category. Provider digital-audio music services, radio-only services, and pay-per-view entries are excluded; actual music television channels are retained. Claro category names are used, categories are ordered by their lowest channel number, and channels are sorted from low to high within each category. Supplemental entries outside the original Claro/Altice PDFs use the station identity number when published. Digital809 TV uses its brand number 809; Televisión Dominicana uses historic DISH slot 844 because it has no single domestic carrier number.",
